.TH PQBLOCKS_POLICY 5 "2026-09-17" "pqblocks 1.0.0" "PQBlocks Policy Manual"
.SH NAME
pqblocks_policy \\- Post-Quantum and Classical Hybrid Cryptographic Policy Object
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <pqblocks_policy.h>
.PP
.BI "PQBLOCKS_POLICY *PQBLOCKS_POLICY_load(const char *" path ");"
.br
.BI "void PQBLOCKS_POLICY_free(PQBLOCKS_POLICY *" policy ");"
.br
.BI "const char *PQBLOCKS_POLICY_get_suite_id(const PQBLOCKS_POLICY *" policy ", size_t index);"
.br
.BI "bool PQBLOCKS_POLICY_is_suite_allowed(const PQBLOCKS_POLICY *" policy ", const char *" suite_id ");"
.br
.SH DESCRIPTION
The pqblocks_policy object provides versioned policy enforcement for hybrid cryptographic suites
in CI/CD pipelines. It defines allowed algorithms, security requirements, and implementation
constraints for the pqblocks-core SDK.
.PP
Policy objects are JSON files with the following structure:
.nf
{
  "schema": "pqblocks-policy/v1",
  "suites": [
    {
      "id": "X25519MLKEM768-Ed25519MLDSA65-HKDF",
      "kem": {
        "primitive": "X25519MLKEM768",
        "kdf": "HKDF-SHA256",
        "shared_secret_len": 32
      },
      "sig": {
        "primitive": "Ed25519+MLDSA65",
        "construction": "CompositeAlgorithmSignatures2025",
        "ctx_label": "ML-DSA-65",
        "euf_cma": true,
        "suf_cma": false
      },
      "security": {
        "security_level": 3,
        "nist_recommended": true,
        "cnsa_2_0_allowed": true
      },
      "implementation": {
        "provider_preference": ["openssl_default", "oqs_provider"],
        "min_openssl_version": "3.5.0"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flags": {
    "require_key_confirmation": true,
    "require_kdf_enforcement": true,
    "enforce_envelope_output": true
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "generated_at": "2026-09-17T00:00:00Z"
}
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
Functions return NULL on failure, or a valid PQBLOCKS_POLICY pointer on success.
Error details can be obtained via PQBLOCKS_strerror().
.SH FILES
$prefix/share/pqblocks/policy/v1.0.0.json
.I pqblocks_policy.h
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pqblocks (3),
.BR pqblocks_hybrid (3)